---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="story">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story__grid">
      <div class="story__photo-wrap reveal">
        <img src={`${base}janice.jpg`} alt="Janice Low" class="story__photo" width="400" height="520" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <div class="story__content reveal">
        <p class="story__label">A Bit About Me</p>
        <h2 class="story__title">I've been where you are.</h2>
        <p class="story__text">I'm a single mother. I've been retrenched. I've felt the weight of not knowing whether my finances could hold if something went wrong.</p>
        <p class="story__text">That's why I became a wealth manager — not to sell policies, but to make sure no one has to figure this out alone. I sit on the same side of the table as you.</p>
        <p class="story__text">I compare all 15 insurers in Singapore. I don't push products — I find what genuinely fits your life stage, your budget, and your worries. And I stay. Monthly updates, WhatsApp replies, annual reviews. I don't disappear after the paperwork.</p>
        <div class="story__trust">
          <div class="story__trust-item">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            <span>MAS Licensed & Regulated</span>
          </div>
          <div class="story__trust-item">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 00-4-4H5a4 4 0 00-4 4v2"/><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="4"/><polyline points="17 11 19 13 23 9"/></svg>
            <span>Compares all 15 insurers</span>
          </div>
          <div class="story__trust-item">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
            <span>Actually replies on WhatsApp</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href={`${base}about`} class="story__link">Get to know me &rarr;</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .story {
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0;
    background: var(--color-light);
  }

  .story__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-2xl);
    align-items: center;
  }

  .story__photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 520px;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    border-radius: 0.75rem;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 48px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .story__label {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .story__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
    color: var(--color-navy);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .story__text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-gray);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .story__text:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .story__trust {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    padding: var(--space-md) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(27,54,93,0.08);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(27,54,93,0.08);
  }

  .story__trust-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-navy);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .story__trust-item svg {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .story__link {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .story__link:hover {
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .story__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
    }
    .story__photo-wrap {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .story__photo {
      width: 280px;
      height: 370px;
    }
  }
</style>
